{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>&gt;A_WINDOW-STACKING_PUZZLE_ADVENTURE_AWAITS</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A peculiar <strong>virus </strong>has taken root at the heart of the <strong>Tabula CS-1</strong>, a computer system that was lost to time. Alongside <strong>Little Bit</strong>, a newly-installed anti-virus, you are tasked with <strong>freeing the computer</strong> from the malware's clutches.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each level in <i>Tabula</i> is comprised of a set of traversable computer windows. <strong>Rearrange </strong>and layer the windows to <strong>create a path</strong>, so that Little Bit can reach and activate the level's <strong>checkpoints</strong>. Activate all checkpoints to <strong>open a portal</strong> to the end of the level!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4100100/extras/61d45dea6fb4080a71b2a5f1c9e64ded.poster.avif?t=1774874291\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4100100/extras/61d45dea6fb4080a71b2a5f1c9e64ded.webm?t=1774874291\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4100100/extras/61d45dea6fb4080a71b2a5f1c9e64ded.mp4?t=1774874291\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>&gt;KEY_FEATURES</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Navigate a <strong>forgotten operating system</strong>, which venerates the unorthodox charm of 90's-era game systems and computer interfaces.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Encounter an array of <strong>puzzle mechanics</strong> that present new solutions to old problems, and challenge you to look at windows in a whole new way.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Discover <strong>multiple solutions</strong> for each and every puzzle - some intended by us, and some invented by you!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Optimise your approach to <strong>achieve gold rank </strong>- activate every checkpoint as fast as you can in a bout for the crown!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Choose the order</strong> in which you play puzzles - beat them in sequence, jump ahead to later folders, and everything in between.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Uncover the <strong>truth behind the creation of the Tabula CS-1</strong>, and the virus that seeks to control it.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li></ul>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/4100100?t=1774874291","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/4100100?t=1774874291","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4100100/6b522c72eb60386f04e05a1c965571469a613247/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1774874291","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4100100/6b522c72eb60386f04e05a1c965571469a613247/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1774874291","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Custom Volume Controls","id":68},{"description":"Playable without Timed Input","id":74},{"description":"Remote Play Together","id":44},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"demos":[{"appid":4116510,"description":""}],"detailed_description":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>&gt;A_WINDOW-STACKING_PUZZLE_ADVENTURE_AWAITS</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A peculiar <strong>virus </strong>has taken root at the heart of the <strong>Tabula CS-1</strong>, a computer system that was lost to time. Alongside <strong>Little Bit</strong>, a newly-installed anti-virus, you are tasked with <strong>freeing the computer</strong> from the malware's clutches.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each leve